"SMB over QUIC runs over UDP port 443 with TLS 1.3. It needs a server that offers it, such as Windows Server 2025." = "SMB over QUIC 透過 UDP 443 連接埠傳輸，使用 TLS 1.3 加密，需要伺服器支援，例如 Windows Server 2025。";
"The newest SMB version the server supports is used, up to SMB 3.1.1, with signing and encryption when the server asks for them. Require Encryption refuses to connect without encryption. Multichannel opens extra connections when the server's network adapter supports RSS, as Windows does. Compression helps on slow links to Windows servers." = "自動使用伺服器支援的最新 SMB 版本（最高 SMB 3.1.1），並依伺服器要求啟用簽章和加密。「要求加密」會拒絕未加密的連線。「多通道」會在伺服器網卡支援 RSS 時額外建立連線，規則與 Windows 相同。「壓縮」適合在慢速網路上連線 Windows 伺服器。";
"The server does not support SMB encryption for this connection. Turn off Require Encryption, or enable SMB 3 encryption on the server." = "伺服器不支援為此連線啟用 SMB 加密。請關閉「要求加密」，或在伺服器上啟用 SMB 3 加密。";
